:: Isshin {"position":"2400,575","size":"100,100"}
<<goto "Isshin_Router">>

:: Isshin_Router {"position":"2400,700","size":"100,100"}
<<set $currentRoute = "isshin">>

<<if not ($isshinBitterSakeSeen || false)>>
  <<goto "Isshin_01_BitterSake">>
<<elseif not ($isshinSparringSeen || false)>>
  <<goto "Isshin_02_BeforeBlade">>
<<elseif not ($isshinLivingBladeSeen || false)>>
  <<goto "Isshin_03_LivingBlade">>
<<elseif (($shura || 0) >= 3 or ($isshinBadPortrait || false)) and not ($isshinShuraPreludeSeen || false)>>
  <<goto "Isshin_04_ShuraPrelude">>
<<else>>
  <<goto "Isshin_06_FinalChoice">>
<</if>>

:: Isshin_01_BitterSake {"position":"2400,775","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<set $currentRoute = "isshin">>
<<set $isshinProgress = Math.max($isshinProgress, 1)>>
<<set $isshinBitterSakeSeen = true>>
<<set $isshinFirstSakeSeen = true>>

<div class="narration">
잔은 이미 두 개 놓여 있었다.

하나는 잇신 앞에.
하나는 늑대가 앉을 자리에.

술 냄새는 진했고,
끝에는 쓴 기운이 남았다.
</div>

<<continueTo "Isshin_01_BitterSake_Talk01">>
<</page>>

:: Isshin_01_BitterSake_Talk01 {"position":"2525,775","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<talk "isshin" "잇신">>
왔느냐, 늑대.

앉아라.
검보다 먼저 손에 쥐는 것도 있어야지.
<</talk>>

<<continueTo "Isshin_01_BitterSake_Talk02">>
<</page>>

:: Isshin_01_BitterSake_Talk02 {"position":"2650,775","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<talk "wolf" "늑대">>
임무 중입니다.
<</talk>>

<<continueTo "Isshin_01_BitterSake_Talk03">>
<</page>>

